  "info": {
    "description": "Reviewed static contract for explicit raw handlers, not automatically generated handlers. JSON request bodies require all declared members; unknown and duplicate members rejected; max 1MiB; valid Unicode without NUL. Authentication validates issuer neutron-data-reference, audience neutron-data-reference-api, nonempty subject, configured tenant. No header or DSN tenant selection.",
